  "description": "Open-source RAW printing middleware for Blazor Server and .NET 10. One SendAsync API accepts text, bytes or lists, with optional caller-supplied idempotency keys. Print to Windows queues, shared network printers and TCP destinations. Supports label, receipt and ordinary-paper printers that accept the supplied language, including ZPL, ESC/POS, PCL and PostScript. Durable local queue and no automatic replay of uncertain delivery. No PDF, HTML or image rendering.",
  "iconFile": "sinergia.png",
