  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "2.1.0: Unified SendAsync overloads accept text, bytes, text lists, byte-array lists and mixed PrintDocument lists. Caller-supplied request keys are optional; omitted keys identify new requests. Prepared documents retain their generated identities across calls. SendByteAsync and SendBatchAsync remain compatible aliases, hidden from IntelliSense. Strict encoding, durable local queue, protocol 2 and no automatic retry of uncertain delivery are preserved. Compatible with Windows agent 2.0.0. See docs/migration-2.1.md.",
